# build tooling: per-plan scratch for subagent-driven execution (ledgers, task
# briefs, review packages). The plans and specs under docs/superpowers/ are
# tracked; this is the machine's working record of executing one, and the git
# history is the durable version of the same thing.
/.superpowers/

# design tooling: DESIGN.md, .impeccable/design.json and .impeccable/live/config.json
# are the design system and are tracked. Everything else under .impeccable/ is a
# generated run artifact (critique reports, the detector cache, live session
# journals) and belongs to the machine that produced it.
/.impeccable/*
!/.impeccable/design.json
!/.impeccable/live/
/.impeccable/live/*
!/.impeccable/live/config.json
